        <type>int</type>
        <definition>int XFlashCFI_ReadCommon</definition>
        <argsstring>(XFlash *InstancePtr, u8 BusWidth)</argsstring>
        <name>XFlashCFI_ReadCommon</name>
        <param>
          <type>XFlash *</type>
          <declname>InstancePtr</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>u8</type>
          <declname>BusWidth</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Retrieves and interprets the standard CFI data from the parts. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Retrieves the standard CFI data from the parts, interprets the data, and updates the provided geometry and properties structures.</para><para>Extended CFI data is part specific and ignored here. This data must be read by the specific flash device family library.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">InstancePtr</parametername>
